            {
              "name": "setup",
              "type": "(context: AudioContext) => Promise<void> | void",
              "optional": false
            }
          ],
          "returnType": "void",
          "description": "Run setup with the shared AudioContext: immediately when it is ready, otherwise once it unlocks. setup must create the nodes behind inputNode and outputNode; the effect counts as wired as soon as it returns. Returning a promise defers ready until it settles. Call it at the end of the subclass constructor, after the fields setup reads are initialized - from a base constructor it could run before them. A subclass's destroy() calls AudioEffect._teardown."
        },
